{
  "x-call": "wingtip_brief::icing_forecast::call",
  "description": "Forecast icing on an IFR route (#216; AIM 7-1-4, 7-1-19): from the NWS's icing grids sampled along each leg (the CIP analysis and the IFI forecast, NWS SCN 26-87), the worst severity at the altitude flown (the levels either side of it), the share of the leg in icing there, the layer icing is forecast in, the worst on the route and the Go / No-Go's line; a leg with no section is unchecked. A leg may send the stored hours near it (`hours`, as icing_forecast_hours picks them, the nearest first) in place of one section: they merge as the owner chose (2026-11-27, \"Grids, worst of nearby hours\"), each point and level the worst of them, the share the nearest hour's own unless it has no icing at the altitude where the merged has.",
